{"4415030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Star Splitters", "steam_appid": 4415030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time 3 Dimensional Naval Combat:</strong> Command your fleet in grand and chaotic battles. Give specific orders or personally take control of one of your ships. The addition of a third dimension adds a new layer of complexity and strategy to battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage a Diverse Fleet of Warships:</strong> Ships come in all shapes and sizes: Massive armoured battleships, carriers with a retinue of fighters and bombers, quick and agile frigates, etc... Your choice of fleet composition may decide whether you come out on top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customise Each of your Ships:</strong> Each turret, missile and fighter has it's specialties and can be switched out at will. A number of upgrades can be fitted to your ships to greatly alter their fighting style. Every ship can be entirely refitted and you choices will decide their role in combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain Favour with the 5 Factions:</strong> Many great heroes and generals battle for control of the galaxy. Complete contracts to earn their favour and unlock their weapons and ship designs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So Far The Game Includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 Different Warships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 Different Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Different Fighters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 Ship Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Different Maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomised Encounters</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">